<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0116_D37R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Somebody tried to scrap me\ndownstairs.\rIt’s ROUGH down there. I lost my\nshoe. And my dignity.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0116_D37R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You look like a good kid.\nHow you end up workin’ for The Feds?\fYour mama know about this?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0116_D37R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Feds won’t stop botherin’\npeople! Show me a WARRANT! I know my\frights!\fI watched a YouTube video!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0116_D37R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s shops downstairs...\rBut there’s Hustlers too. They\nask for “a dollar for the toll.”\fThere ain’t no toll.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0116_D37R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yeah... The Feds can use the tunnel\ntoo. Public property.\rTaxpayers paid for this tunnel and\nnow it got Feds in it. Classic.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0116_D37R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Everybody who worked down here\ndipped. Nobody want The Feds in their\fbusiness.\fEspecially the herbal medicine guy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0116_D37R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nYou right on time!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0116_D37R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Follow this tunnel and\nyou’ll see a Dress-Up Shop.\rThat’s where your homies put on\nAccessories to get fly and\ftake pics!\rOh, and here go the Fashion Case!\rYou said you want it?\nI knew it!\rIt’s a gift from me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0116_D37R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Keep your Accessories in the\nFashion Case, OK?\rI gotta go.\nLater!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0116_D37R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nYou right on time!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0116_D37R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Follow this tunnel and\nyou’ll see a Dress-Up Shop.\rThat’s where your homies put on\nAccessories to get fly and\ftake pics!\rOh, and here go the Fashion Case!\rYou said you want it?\nI knew it!\rIt’s a gift from me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0116_D37R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Keep your Accessories in the\nFashion Case, OK?\rI gotta go.\nLater!\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
